    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μᾰρᾰθών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ὁ, also ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>O.</u>
			13.110
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάραθον</span>):—<u>Marathon</u>, so called from its
		being <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overgrown with
			fennel</i> (<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.4.9
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.62
			</span></i>, etc.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μαραθῶνι</span></b> 
			<i>at M.</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				781
			</span></i>, etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μαραθῶνάδε</span></b> 
			<i>to M.</i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.107
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μαραθωνόθεν</span></b> 
			<i>from M.</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				2.218J.
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μᾰρᾰθώνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ον; Μ., τά</span>, <i>festival in
				celebration of the victory of Marathon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				5.17
			</span></i>.</div>
